        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.18873">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2602.18873">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2602.18873">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
